      "id": "sce-pitch-problem-solution-market-c1",
      "heading": "The template and the problem statement",
      "explanation_md": "This deck is a **startup pitching template for a very early stage** venture. Each slide is a heading with a prompt and blank space: your team fills it in for your own startup. The cover asks for your **Startup NAME** and **what you aspire to do, in the most interesting manner**.\n\nThe first content slide is the **Problem Statement: Problem that you intend to Solve**. Next to it is a picture of a **magnifying glass surrounded by question marks**.\n\nSo the pitch opens with the problem, before anything about your product.",
      "example_ids": [
        "sce-ex-pitch-question-marks"
      ],
